{"product_id":"wee-girls","title":"Wee Girls","description":"\u003cp\u003eWomen writing from an Irish perspective. The collection includes Helena Mulkerns' Famine Fever, a story on the Great Famine, Robyn Rowland's Searching, which is on a woman's visit to the country of her ancestors, and Eavan Boland's The Emigrant Irish, on the life of the Irish in the New World. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:127 x 200  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Lizz Murphy \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781875559510 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 373\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44898552971417,"sku":"11RD9781875559510","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/2a86a0366cc8d5692f35752db248b7ee.jpg?v=1729003228","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/wee-girls","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}